        <p>Mr. Lester has l'een for a number r f years a University Extension lecturer of Manchester and Liverpool Universities. He Ives appointed in 19117 a special lecturer in connection skit the Manchester ruivvraity Extension Lecture. to Sunday achocl teachers and has been giving courses of lectures for. eeveral winters in Manchester, Oldham and other Lancashire towns. Piece 1906 Mr. Lester has been examiner to the Lverpol Council of E lac ation and Education Committee and has recently been appointed to examine for the Univeriity of Liverpool.</p>
