        <p>Mr. Linaker, see., moved that as far as it affected their road the Council should accede to the request. Mr. Woodward seconded. Ile remarked that the preperty owners c, old prot,ct theirsel‘es ard he cc.ld tot tee that the ',kerne was at all likely to interfere with them.</p>
