        <head>GOLFING ABROAD.</head>
        <p>GOLFING ABROAD.</p>
        <p>I The famous Golf Links at he Zoote-Knocks, Belgium are pretty well full sad many vieitors are staying at Bruges, comfortably near by tram or train, 'pending 'their days at Le Zonte-Knocke. There is no doubt that this rising station has the very finest links on the ,'do. tinsel', and the plots of land for building purpows at ' present going so cheap, will he certain to Increase in price yen, sbortiy. Intending purchasers should bear In mind thst there ere no death &amp;Cos in Belgium. Th• proximity of fondue, nix D war-Ostend, tends to make 11, Zotete.Kuocke • favourite week end resort amongst the overworked city men in need of bracing air and lovers of the health-giving game.</p>
