        <p>" WOMEN AS A DVOCAT ES."</p>
        <p>Under this heading, the writer of the London /otter . in the "Daily News " mentions the appearance of a little Jewiali girl in an East End County Court as advocate for her father, ard adds that it is not unusual to allow such unconventional representatiou. The best woman] advocats I ever heard was one of the comparatively few lady factory inspectors. She appeared in support of a monotone charging a lirm of wholesale clothiers with employing women workers during illegal hours, and she certainly was as selbposs.ssed and as smart in the conduct of the CB. BS any man I have met in similar, circumstances. Women long ago succetsfolly invaded the ranks of the doctors (the resident surgeon at the above-mentioned sanatorium is a larly,and the patients cre all males) and if she should be allowed to erotic. law, the most eminent men advocahs will have I. look to their laurels. flat of course they know th it well ennigh,and vfill take good care to keep the ladies omside is long as posiihle.</p>
