        <p>CIIOI R. Ex, RSIOS.—The members of the choir, Sunday school teachers, and all other Church workera, bed their annual excursion on Saturday last, Bleckpool being the place visited. The party numbering about CC left the village in a bus in time to catch the 0.13 from Bank Quay, but, owing to a tuisumlerstanding missed the train, audio lid not arrive at Backpool until after II o'clock. The weather was all that could be desired, and aver! pleasant lay was spent, lila psrty breaking up and visiting all the plactot of amusements. ..I meeting again at the Ilee Cafe, saber« ten bed been arranged for at five o'clock, arriving back in Warrington about 11.30.</p>
