        <p>rolling took place yestexley in the Luton Division of Iledfordshire for the election of a member of Parliament ta succeed Mr. T. G. Ashton, created Lord Aslitre .I Hyde. The candidatrs were Mr. C. Ilatmaworth iLiberol) awl Mr. J. 0. Hickman (Conservative). The result was declared to-day as follow.: Ilarmsworth (L) 7.1119 ickman LOW Liberal majority 613 PREVIOUS FIGURES</p>
